{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37730","headline":"蜀中三首 一 · 郑谷","name":"蜀中三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"马头春向鹿头关。\n远树平芜一望闲，雪下文君沾酒市。\n云藏李白读书山，江楼客恨黄梅後。\n村落人歌紫芋间，堤月桥灯好时景。\n汉庭无事不征蛮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}